    "details": "Oracle reports:\n\n> The October 2026 Critical Patch Update contains 98 new security\n> patches for Oracle MySQL, 29 of which may be remotely exploitable\n> without authentication.\n>\n> Eight of them affect the MySQL Connectors. The most severe, in\n> Connector/J, can be exploited over a network without authentication.\n> The fixes are contained in release 26.10.0 of each connector.\n",
